    "view": {
      "mode": "multiple",
      "stem": "Consider the sum 26*27*28*29 + 51*52*53*54, the difference 41*43*45*47 - 37*39*41*42, the product of every natural number from 7 through 81 inclusive, and the sum of all three-digit numbers. Select every true assertion about their last digits.",
